On 5/6/2011 10:09 AM, Hans Vlems wrote:

> There are several interesting stories about moving VAX hardware.
> I noticed that the livingcomputermuseum site uses the model number
> 11/780-5, while I'm fairly sure it was called a VAX 11/785 by DEC.
> Any reason for adopting this somewhat strange nomenclature? The VAX
